00:00:53.079 --> 00:00:59.039
This time he wanted to talk to them and they
actually say Trump had invited us to Mar a

00:00:59.039 --> 00:01:00.039
Lago.

00:01:00.039 --> 00:01:01.810
Let me make sure we have this on screen.

00:01:01.810 --> 00:01:04.720
Trump It invited us to Mar a Lago to interview
him for this book.

00:01:04.720 --> 00:01:08.560
He had declined an interview for our first
book about his presidency and when a very

00:01:08.560 --> 00:01:13.220
stable genius was published in January of
twenty twenty, attacked us personally and

00:01:13.220 --> 00:01:15.650
