00:01:15.650 --> 00:01:17.409
But Trump was quick to agree to our request.

00:01:17.409 --> 00:01:19.960
This time he sought to curate history.

00:01:19.960 --> 00:01:21.060
Listen to this.

00:01:21.060 --> 00:01:26.260
As we sat for the interview, the president's
former president's press secretary presented

00:01:26.260 --> 00:01:31.619
us with with copies of a bound volume One
Thousand Accomplishments of President Donald

00:01:31.619 --> 00:01:32.619
