00:02:07.090 --> 00:02:08.690
his biggest regret.

00:02:08.690 --> 00:02:12.849
This is absolutely fascinating and very, very
scary.

00:02:12.849 --> 00:02:19.000
Over the years, Trump rarely has expressed
misgivings, but he regrets his response to

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:23.129
protests last summer in Minneapolis, Portland,
Seattle and other cities.

00:02:23.129 --> 00:02:28.790
Now, you might hear that and say, oh, maybe
he regrets threatening to send in military.

00:02:28.790 --> 00:02:33.629
Maybe he regrets the despicable things he
said about protesters are defending the police

00:02:33.629 --> 00:02:34.629
