00:02:34.629 --> 00:02:36.390
No, no, no, no, no.

00:02:36.390 --> 00:02:43.170
I think if I had to do it again, I would have
brought in the military immediately.

00:02:43.170 --> 00:02:44.830
He said.

00:02:44.830 --> 00:02:48.200
What if he had another opportunity?

00:02:48.200 --> 00:02:54.260
He would have more quickly scaled up the violence
