00:02:54.260 --> 00:02:55.260
military.

00:02:55.260 --> 00:02:59.910
Remember when he was thinking about this,
that I and others said, OK, so hold on a second.

00:02:59.910 --> 00:03:05.269
You have protests triggered by excessive use
of force by law enforcement against George

00:03:05.269 --> 00:03:09.300
Floyd that that was the catalyst for these
protests.

00:03:09.300 --> 00:03:16.060
Trump's natural instinct is to send in military
to shut down the protests, which were overwhelmingly

00:03:16.060 --> 00:03:17.410
peaceful.

00:03:17.410 --> 00:03:23.140
That is truly the tendency, the knee jerk
reaction of an authoritarian.

00:03:23.140 --> 00:03:24.610
It's a horrible thing.

00:03:24.610 --> 00:03:28.409
Now, ultimately, it didn't end up going down
that way and that's a very good thing and

00:03:28.409 --> 00:03:31.090
get having a chance to do it over again, Trump
says.

00:03:31.090 --> 00:03:34.840
I wish I had sent in the military more quickly.

00:03:34.840 --> 00:03:38.769
Trump had they go on to say Trump had no such
second thoughts about his handling of the

00:03:38.769 --> 00:03:39.769
pandemic.

00:03:39.769 --> 00:03:43.220
He said he had been very tough in protecting
