00:04:03.950 --> 00:04:08.240
Trump may have been pushing people, but there
is no reason to believe, based on everything

00:04:08.240 --> 00:04:12.520
we know, that Trump had anything to do with
these vaccines being approved any quicker

00:04:12.520 --> 00:04:14.860
than they would have been without him.

00:04:14.860 --> 00:04:16.140
This is just a delusion.

00:04:16.140 --> 00:04:21.489
One last bit of flavor quote, I think we did
a great job on covid and it hasn't been recognized,

00:04:21.489 --> 00:04:25.620
Trump said, noting other countries saw spikes
