00:04:28.280 --> 00:04:29.900
We didn't have gowns.

00:04:29.900 --> 00:04:31.380
We didn't have masks.

00:04:31.380 --> 00:04:33.000
We didn't have ventilators.

00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:34.050
We didn't have anything.

00:04:34.050 --> 00:04:36.490
We brought in plane loads.

00:04:36.490 --> 00:04:38.510
We did a great job.

00:04:38.510 --> 00:04:42.510
When we asked Trump why, he encouraged people
