00:05:00.550 --> 00:05:02.190
longer than any other professor.

00:05:02.190 --> 00:05:03.190
Totally brilliant man.

00:05:03.190 --> 00:05:04.190
He had numerous degrees.

00:05:04.190 --> 00:05:05.370
So that's in the genes.

00:05:05.370 --> 00:05:09.150
I always go with that stuff, but it's a little
