00:05:09.150 --> 00:05:11.080
And Dr. John Trump was a great guy.

00:05:11.080 --> 00:05:12.870
No, I'm a big believer in science.

00:05:12.870 --> 00:05:15.080
If I wasn't, you wouldn't have a vaccine.

00:05:15.080 --> 00:05:16.080
It depends.

00:05:16.080 --> 00:05:19.410
Are you talking about disinformation or are
you talking about lies?

00:05:19.410 --> 00:05:22.530
There's a more beautiful word called disinformation.

00:05:22.530 --> 00:05:27.770
So Trump seems to be saying he didn't lie,
but he did spread disinformation, which I

00:05:27.770 --> 00:05:32.539
